Error [jet.SingleUseDropped]: `tx` still owes `consume`, but this `return` leaves with it undone
  --> tests/ui/ownership/single_use_return_leaves_transaction_open.jet:10:16
    |
 10 |     if keep -> return
    |                ^^^^^^
 Why: This value's type is `#SingleUse`, so its job has to be done before the function hands control back — returning here leaves the work undone (an open transaction, an unreleased lock)
 Fix: Consume `tx` before this `return` (commit or roll back the transaction, release the lock), or return it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0140
